    "source": {
      "value": "av0"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "You're a trained physician who can ably tend wounds of many kinds. But more than a practitioner, you're a scholar.\n\nSome cultures shape flesh to extreme degrees, creating aberrations from humanoid forms. The fleshforges of distant Nex practice this fleshwarping, as do certain subterranean societies you hope to one day study\u2014preferably from a safe and clinical distance.\n\nChoose two ability boosts. One must be to Intelligence or Wisdom, and one is a free ability boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Medicine skill and the Fleshwarp Lore skill. You gain the Assurance skill feat with Medicine."
    },
